        "original_id": "3f91db6a-306a-5c45-9b6e-8df5efce3fc5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat, Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, Abby Ryder Fortson\n- Works: Ant-Man, The Kid Who Would Be King, Saturday Night Live\n- Characters: Cassandra Lang, Cassie Lang\n- Roles: head writer, director, writer, co-writer, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Adam McKay served as head writer for the NBC sketch comedy series Saturday Night Live for two seasons.\n- In 2015, Cassie Lang made her cinematic debut in the film Ant-Man, and Abby Ryder Fortson portrayed the character.\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote Ant-Man with Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, and Paul Rudd.\n- Joe Cornish also co-wrote an unspecified work with Steven Moffat and Edgar Wright.\n- The Kid Who Would Be King is an upcoming British-American adventure drama film written and directed by Joe Cornish.",
